  "abstract": "Covers the AsyncAPI Specification from the AsyncAPI Initiative across its version lines: AsyncAPI 3.1 (current, 3.1.0), AsyncAPI 3.0 (supported, 3.0.0) and AsyncAPI 2.6 (legacy, standing for 2.x, read and upgraded from). It teaches describing message-driven applications with servers, channels, operations, messages, replies, protocol bindings, security schemes, multi-format schemas, correlation IDs and traits; upgrading 2.x and 3.0 documents to 3.1; and validating against the official AsyncAPI JSON Schemas plus the rules they cannot express. No 4.0 preview exists. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out versions, objects, bindings and security, migration, validation and examples.",
